                                                          │ ○ 6  Manage apps with an app of apps    
                                                          │                                         
                                                          │ Argo CD keeps a cluster in line with    
                                                          │ what Git says. In this lab you install  
                                                          │ it on an empty cluster, deploy an app   
                                                          │ from Git, watch it undo a change made   
                                                          │ by hand, and then let one Application   
                                                          │ manage others.                          
